{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026fFglz3qCgv1792742678.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>今日是二十四節氣的霜降，是入冬前最後一個節氣，天文台錄得32.3度，是1884年有紀錄以來最熱的霜降。</p><p></p><p>乾燥的東北季候風帶來晴朗的天氣。多區氣溫錄得超過30度，上水更超過34度。上一次最熱的霜降是2006年，當天最高氣溫31度。今年再破紀錄。</p><p></p><p>天文台預料，未來一兩日繼續晴朗，日夜溫差頗大。隨著季候風補充逐漸影響華南沿岸，下周中期風勢頗大，雲量較多。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T09:03:57.715019+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":175,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T06:48:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T09:38:18.077547+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T08:58:11.585893+00:00","content_hash":"5bf1fab670d04380bda1418e0b7528f25e504e877eaf05076df81f47ac279674","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T09:03:57.715019+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}